<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The emergence of novel nation-state operations, such as the Muddling Meerkat DNS mystery, further illustrates the complex interplay of espionage and cybercrime. These sophisticated campaigns blur the lines between geopolitical motives and traditional hacking, often leveraging stealthy techniques to compromise infrastructure and conduct reconnaissance. Such developments challenge defenders to adopt more proactive, intelligence-driven approaches to anticipate and mitigate threats from well-resourced adversaries.)
/E (The emergence of novel nation-state operations, such as the Muddling Meerkat DNS mystery, further illustrates the complex interplay of espionage and cybercrime. These sophisticated campaigns blur the lines between geopolitical motives and traditional hacking, often leveraging stealthy techniques to compromise infrastructure and conduct reconnaissance. Such developments challenge defenders to adopt more proactive, intelligence-driven approaches to anticipate and mitigate threats from well-resourced adversaries.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
