345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The percent of threats on our network increased significantly in 2024. While still under 1% of all network traffic, identified threats on our network grew by 36% between October 2023 and September 2024. The relative distribution of threats remained consistent over time, though the percent of malware queries increased by 14% and phishing increased by 203%. This is in-line with the marked increase in ransomware seen across the industry, with phishing being the most common method for ransomware distribution. )
/E (The percent of threats on our network increased significantly in 2024. While still under 1% of all network traffic, identified threats on our network grew by 36% between October 2023 and September 2024. The relative distribution of threats remained consistent over time, though the percent of malware queries increased by 14% and phishing increased by 203%. This is in-line with the marked increase in ransomware seen across the industry, with phishing being the most common method for ransomware distribution. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
